<title>HONG KONG: HKFE sets US$3,500 margin for rolling stg contract.</title>
<headline>HKFE sets US$3,500 margin for rolling stg contract.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Futures Exchange said on Monday the initial margin rate for its Rolling Forex Sterling Contract clients would be set at US$3,500 per lot.</p>
<p>The contract size for the sterling contract would be 50,000 stg with a minimum fluctuation of 0.0001 and tick value of US$5, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
